{"id":"posibilidad","lemma":"posibilidad","pos":"noun","rank":1014,"glosses":["possibility","means","potential, chance, odds, opportunity"],"ipa":"/posibiliˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"posibilidades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/14/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-posibilidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es una posibilidad, ¿no?","en":"That's a possibility, isn't it?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/538337"},{"text":"Sólo hay tres posibilidades.","en":"There are only three possibilities.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/456711"},{"text":"Eso es una posibilidad espantosa.","en":"That's a frightening possibility.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/598537"},{"text":"Tenemos pocas posibilidades de ganar.","en":"We have little chance of winning.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/353786"},{"text":"He considerado esa posibilidad también.","en":"I've considered that possibility as well.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523205"}]}